WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.269
Hi! Do you have a bucket list? Here's mine!

2
00:00:05.719 --> 00:00:09.248
I'd like to go on a hot-air balloon in Turkey.

3
00:00:11.498 --> 00:00:15.260
I'd like to get a small tattoo. A flower, maybe!

4
00:00:17.510 --> 00:00:19.925
I'd really like to run a marathon.

5
00:00:22.175 --> 00:00:24.915
And I'd like to learn to ride a horse.

6
00:00:27.165 --> 00:00:31.902
But I wouldn't like to go bungee jumping. I'm afraid of heights!

7
00:00:32.352 --> 00:00:35.231
And you? What's on your bucket list?

